<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hellfire</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 32)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast hellfire &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast hellfire</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The second of the dark knight's fires: flames from below engulf the target. 
The better your power and fire sphere, the more it burns. Unlike lava flow, 
it is fierce against those in clothes or leather, and weak against plate. A 
shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on staffs, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Lava Flow</a>
